    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A node in the Global Industry Classification Standard (GICS) hierarchy (MSCI / S&amp;P Dow Jones Indices). GICS publishes no URIs, so the nodes are minted here and carry the official 2-, 4-, 6- or 8-digit GICS code as skos:notation.</rdfs:comment>
